% Built at P7 (2026-07-28). Every entry below was cross-verified against two
% independent sources before being written; the queries, the exact source URLs,
% and what each source confirmed are in
% papers/phase1-workshop/runs/20260728T102014Z-P7/search-traces/, one file per
% line of related work, plus an adversarial re-check over a 20% sample.
%
% THE RULE THIS FILE IS UNDER. A record that could not be confirmed twice is not
% here. Where a work has no citable venue, the entry is @misc and says so; no
% arXiv id, DOI, volume or page range appears in this file that was not resolved
% against a source. Do not add an entry by hand without adding its trace.
%
% Known traps, each of which cost a lookup and would otherwise have shipped:
%   * Ha & Schmidhuber is TWO records. "World Models" (1803.10122) was never
%     published under that title; the NeurIPS 2018 paper is 1809.01999 and is
%     titled "Recurrent World Models Facilitate Policy Evolution". A citation
%     reading "World Models, NeurIPS 2018" does not exist.
%   * I-JEPA's own arXiv comment names ICCV. It is CVPR 2023.
%   * DreamerV3 changed title between preprint ("Diverse Domains") and Nature
%     ("diverse control tasks").
%   * Petri 1962 is a TH Darmstadt dissertation. Bonn is the publication locus,
%     not the awarding institution; "University of Bonn" is a widespread error.
%   * AlphaProof's Nature paper does not contain "AlphaProof" in its title, so
%     searching the system name returns nothing and invites invention.
%   * The Dijkstra sentence is EWD249's own wording. The shorter form usually
%     quoted is not what EWD249 says — see dijkstra1970notes.

